  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. Inclusive jet spectra from pp and PbPb collisions at 2.76 TeV collected by the CMS experiment. Jets are reconstructed with three different distance parameters (R=0.2, 0.3, and 0.4) for transverse momentum pT>70GeV/c and pseudorapidity |eta|<2. The production cross sections and nuclear modification factor RAA is presented as function of pT and event centrality, for each R. \n",
